WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:03.727
Sam gives Alex his Ninja Foodi.

00:00:03.727 --> 00:00:07.658
Months later, the pressure-cooking lid is recalled.

00:00:07.658 --> 00:00:10.227
The notice reaches Sam.

00:00:10.227 --> 00:00:13.186
The cooker is in Alex’s kitchen.

00:00:13.186 --> 00:00:18.019
Recall Relay carries the next step to the person who can act.

00:00:19.310 --> 00:00:24.196
This is an Alexa+ concept with a real MCP service.

00:00:24.196 --> 00:00:28.696
We’re using an official US recall and a sample household.

00:00:28.696 --> 00:00:32.529
Sam says, I gave my Foodi to Alex.

00:00:32.529 --> 00:00:36.904
One shareable card carries the recall and model note.

00:00:36.904 --> 00:00:40.015
Alex opens a personal case.

00:00:41.310 --> 00:00:48.960
On the companion screen, Alex adds a label photo and reads OP301 I07.

00:00:48.960 --> 00:00:52.418
The checked model matches the official list.

00:00:52.418 --> 00:01:01.098
Now the guidance is specific: stop pressure cooking; air frying and other functions can continue under the recall notice.

00:01:01.098 --> 00:01:06.265
The photo stays on Alex’s device, ready for the manufacturer.

00:01:07.550 --> 00:01:13.741
Here, a connected agent receives Alex’s request: I stopped pressure cooking.

00:01:13.741 --> 00:01:16.061
My photo is ready.

00:01:16.061 --> 00:01:18.450
Help me get the new lid.

00:01:18.450 --> 00:01:24.380
It chooses the tools, saves progress, and prepares the official request.

00:01:24.380 --> 00:01:28.936
Watch the same open page change with each committed result.

00:01:30.202 --> 00:01:37.824
Alex opens SharkNinja’s official form, where the manufacturer collects the photo and delivery details.

00:01:37.824 --> 00:01:45.088
Back in Relay, we record a sample confirmation email, then the reported disposal of the old lid.

00:01:45.088 --> 00:01:48.338
The next step is waiting for delivery.

00:01:49.602 --> 00:01:55.668
A few days later in our scenario, Alex returns: The replacement arrived.

00:01:55.668 --> 00:01:57.502
Where were we?

00:01:57.502 --> 00:02:01.918
A fresh agent conversation retrieves the saved case.

00:02:01.918 --> 00:02:07.196
It remembers the checked model, the current owner, and completed steps.

00:02:07.196 --> 00:02:10.613
The screen moves to fitting the replacement.

00:02:10.613 --> 00:02:13.752
Alex records that final step.

00:02:15.014 --> 00:02:19.344
One cooker, two owners, a completed handoff.

00:02:19.344 --> 00:02:27.830
Recall Relay connects a recall to the person holding the product—and carries the remedy through the interruptions of real life.

00:02:27.830 --> 00:02:33.677
Try the working browser concept, or run the open-source MCP service.
